      <title>习近平、特朗普与普京在深圳举行历史性会晤，发布和平宣言并就AI军事决策达成共识</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-213559&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_f133f77340a7</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-213559:evt_f133f77340a7</guid>
